OL,3,ACitroen revives the 2CV for an electric
OL,4,Aage
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench carmaker Citroen has brought
OL,7,Fback its 2CV brand in a bid to boost
OL,8,Fsales of electric cars in a difficult
OL,9,Fmarket.
OL,11,FThe new model, unveiled at the Paris
OL,12,FMotor Show, is a small city runabout
OL,13,Fwith retro styling which harks back to
OL,14,Fone of the company's most famous
OL,15,Fdesigns.
OL,17,FAs a "concept car" intended to show
OL,18,FCitroen's direction of travel, it is
OL,19,Fnot yet ready to go on sale but the
OL,20,Fplan is to have a version in showrooms
OL,21,Fby 2028.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
