OL,3,ACitroen revives the 2CV for an electric
OL,4,Aage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs they face mounting competition from
OL,7,FChinese manufacturers, Citroen and
OL,8,Fother European brands are exploiting
OL,9,Ftheir heritage as a means of selling
OL,10,Fmodern motors.
